  "2026-07-29T04:33:36.604Z",pi-agent,"Audit results: --all flag: no hits. GH-651 workaround FOUND and REMOVED: normalizeCheckpoint() function in index.ts was signing bare relative windows (e.g. '7d' -> '-7d') because pm activity --from bare windows used to return empty. Removed the signing logic; function now just trims whitespace. Updated tests and README accordingly. GH-672/676/785/792/794: no hits, not applicable."
close_reason: "Bumped @unbrained/pm-cli devDependency to ^2026.7.29. No peerDependency declared so none added. Audited for removed --all flag: no hits. Removed GH-651 workaround: normalizeCheckpoint() no longer signs bare relative windows (e.g. '7d' -> '-7d') since pm activity --from now accepts bare windows directly (fixed in 2026.7.29). Updated tests and README. GH-672/676/785/792/794: none applicable. All quality gates green: 160 tests pass, coverage lines 92.03%, branches 76.80%, functions 95.85% (thresholds met). Changelog check and audit:prod clean."
